	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Heri ad Termas <placeName ref="l24">Badenses</placeName> post diuturnos et lętales quidem morbos, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>quos decem integros fere menses pertuli, perveni, non autem <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>directo itinere, sed prius <placeName ref="l28">Basilea</placeName> visa huc contendi filio <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>meo <persName ref="p20383">Iona</persName> itineris comite assumpto, qui modo non minus <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>quam ego necessitate coactus in termis lavat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Quomodo res <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>imperii tum et meę habent, paucis explicari non potest.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Si autem putas vestrę reipublicę interesse hęc mature scire, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>per fidelem internuntium id fieri potest, qui me tuis saltem <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>testimoniis appellet; tunc nil morabor ei ea, quę vestra <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>referre possunt, plene exponere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Ego iactor misere incertisque <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>sedibus hinc inde vagor nec aliam habeo consolationem, quam <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>quod scriptura promittit hoc verbo: Quos deus diligit, corripit etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Filium meum <persName ref="p20383">Ionam</persName> nunc 16. annum agentem posthabitis aliis <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>rationibus propterea mecum huc vexi, ut ipsum scholę <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>alumnum facerem nil pensi habens, quod antea academiis <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>fuerat addictus; suprema enim academia Helvetiorum videtur <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>mihi esse piorum et eruditorum conventus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/><placeName ref="l24">Badeę</placeName> apud hospitem posteriorum termarum cum aliquot <lb xml:id="p1z19"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinis</placeName> dego, apud quos deo volente reperiar quatuordecim <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>diebus.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Spero me ad vos adventurum; interim vero <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>de preceptore et hospite frugi filio meo prospitias, oro, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>et si per negotia licet, unum atque alterum verbum rescribe.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Vale et dominos fratres tum et consules, d. <persName ref="p1888">Lavaterum</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>et <persName ref="p1419">Habium</persName>, diligentissime nomine meo salutato.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Raptim <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>ex Termis <placeName ref="l24">Badensibus</placeName> 20. aprilis anno etc. 53.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Tuus ex animo <persName ref="p8354">Georgius Lętus</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>a <placeName>Loümitz</placeName><note type="margin">a.R.: od. <placeName>Lömnitz</placeName> / Louͤmitz</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Dem hochgelerten unnd <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>fromen herren <persName ref="p495">Hennrichen <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Bullinger</persName>, vorgeern<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Antistes.</note> der <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>christenlichen gmeind zu <lb xml:id="p2z5"/><placeName ref="l587">Zurch</placeName>, minem gunnstigen <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>herren zu hannden.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Zurch</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>